<title>INDONESIA: PERTAMINA RESTARTS BALIKPAPAN REFINERY-OFFICIAL.</title>
<headline>PERTAMINA RESTARTS BALIKPAPAN REFINERY-OFFICIAL.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's state oil company Pertamina said it had on Monday resumed operations at its 200,000 barrels-per-day Balikpapan refinery after a 30-day routine maintenance shutdown.</p>
</text>
